  "slug": "lime-fluff",
  "name": "Lime Fluff",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "A Georgia favorite! Great with everything! Make a lot for large gatherings, it disappears quickly! You can use any kind of nuts you like; adjust the amount to suit your preference.",
  "cuisine": "Southern",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "In a large bowl, mix together gelatin, whipped topping, pineapple with juice, sour cream, marshmallows, and pecans. Cover and chill in refrigerator for at least 1 hour. Serve cold."
    }
  ],
